                  "content": "// Elevated (기본)\nCard(child: Padding(\n  padding: EdgeInsets.all(16),\n  child: Text('Content'),\n))\n\n// Filled\nCard.filled(child: Padding(...))\n\n// Outlined\nCard.outlined(child: Padding(...))",
